  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/si-select (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) runs at install time: it downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases (bun-v1.3.13) and executes a bundled 727KB heavily-obfuscated script (math_init.js) with that runtime. No exfiltration endpoints or credential reads appear in plaintext; the payload's behavior is concealed by the obfuscation. Installing this package executes an opaque, obfuscated payload via a downloaded runtime, unrelated to the package's stated purpose as a UI select component.",
